उन्-मेष, अस्, m. opening the eyes, looking at;
winking, twinkling or upward motion of the eyelids;
blowing or blossoming of a flower; awaking, becom-
ing visible.

उन्-मीलित, अस्, आ, अम्, opened (as the eyes);
blown as a flower; (अम्), n. unconcealed or open
reference or allusion (to anything, in rhetoric).

उन्मृज् उन्-मृज् (उद्-म्˚), cl. 2. P. -मार्ष्टि,
मार्जितुम् or -मार्ष्टुम्, to rub off, wipe off;
efface; blot out.
